{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Bread according to the little ones.</b> Even though it was in his power to provide them abundant food, he gave them only a sufficient measure, as our Sages of blessed memory said (Ta'anit 11a): when the public is in distress, a person should not say, 'I shall go home and eat and drink, and peace be upon you, my soul.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:55.566668912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}